stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB

  state "旋转模式" as ROTATE {
    direction LR
    [*] --> CW
    CW --> CCW: 切换为 CCW
    CCW --> CW: 切换为 CW
  }

  state "HOLD（停止保持）" as HOLD

  [*] --> ROTATE
  ROTATE --> HOLD: 完全张掌持续 1 秒
  HOLD --> ROTATE: 恢复抓握约 0.2 秒，返回原方向

  note right of HOLD
    锁存当前 PD target
    绕过 Diffusion / IDM
    保持夹持，不随张手松开
  end note
